{"corpus":"ccc","number":363,"text_html":"<span>Souvent, le terme <i class=\"typo_italic\">âme</i> désigne dans l’Écriture Sainte la <i class=\"typo_italic\">vie</i> humaine <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup> ou toute la <i class=\"typo_italic\">personne</i> humaine<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§1703</sup> <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"3\">2</sup>. Mais il désigne aussi ce qu’il y a de plus intime en l’homme <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"4\">3</sup> et de plus grande valeur en lui <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">4</sup>, ce par quoi il est plus particulièrement image de Dieu : « âme » signifie le <i class=\"typo_italic\">principe spirituel</i> en l’homme.</span>","cross_refs":["1703"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Mt 16:25-26"},{"text":"Jn 15:13"},{"text":"Ac 2:41"},{"text":"Mt 26:38"},{"text":"Jn 12:27"},{"text":"Mt 10:28"},{"text":"Mt 2 M 6:30"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 16:25-26","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Jn 15:13","idx":2,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ac 2:41","idx":3,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 26:38","idx":4,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"Jn 12:27","idx":5,"marker_idx":4,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 10:28","idx":6,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"2 M 6:30","idx":7,"marker_idx":6,"display_idx":4}]}